- difficulty_1_to_5: 4
- description: Implement a staged prototype that first computes compact per-token router/coefficient state and FP32 parameter-gradient partials, then consumes that state in a dedicated dense input-gradient pass.
- expected_vs_baseline_factor: 6.50x
